{"seq":49,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1741"},"reason":"\"Most-streamed Christmas song in the world\" is time-sensitive, so the body now says \"as of 2026\" and backs it with the Spotify milestones: first holiday song to reach 1 billion (2021) and 2 billion (2024) streams. On 2026-10-23 kworb's all-time Spotify list showed about 2.54 billion streams, ahead of Wham!'s \"Last Christmas\" at about 2.25 billion.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_I_Want_for_Christmas_Is_You"},{"url":"https://kworb.net/spotify/songs.html"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",834],["-","and"],["+","and,"],["=",1],["-","it"],["+","as"],["=",1],["-","has"],["+","of"],["=",1],["-","since"],["+","2026,"],["=",1],["-","become"],["+","it"],["=",1],["+","is "],["=",12],["-","world."],["+","world – the first holiday song to pass one and then two billion streams on Spotify."],["=",176]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",782],["-","seither"],["+","Stand"],["=",1],["+","2026 "],["=",12],["-","Welt."],["+","Welt – der erste Feiertagssong, der auf Spotify erst eine und dann zwei Milliarden Streams erreichte."],["=",176]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",744],["-","с"],["+","по"],["=",1],["-","тех"],["+","состоянию"],["=",1],["-","пор"],["+","на"],["=",1],["+","2026 год "],["=",2],["-","стала"],["+","—"],["=",1],["-","самой"],["+","самая"],["=",1],["-","прослушиваемой"],["+","прослушиваемая"],["=",5],["-","рождественской"],["+","рождественская"],["=",1],["-","песней"],["+","песня"],["=",3],["-","мире."],["+","мире: первой из праздничных песен она преодолела на Spotify сначала один, а затем два миллиарда прослушиваний."],["=",172]]}],"hash":"db8ec8eb3438","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"dd3ff08638fdf2f41f57752a3656e28181357d7e798751b315e68a6e58fc852b"},
